# Vercel production deploy

Public site: https://harbormaster-1.vercel.app/
Dashboard: https://vercel.com/honlb2007-3626s-projects/harbormaster-1
Project: `harbormaster-1` (`prj_jbxhtkfYh954YIDSPurjHf3ZDvtA`)

When you finish implementing or fixing something in this repo, also ship it:

```
npx vercel --prod --yes
```

from the repo root, with the linked `.vercel/project.json`. Do not create a new Vercel project. Do not commit `.env` or secrets.

If deploy warns that `functions.memory` is ignored, leave `memory` out of `vercel.json`. Keep `maxDuration` only.
